@startuml UC5_VisualizeSessionLog_Local
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC5] Visualize a session in the personal sessions log

' =======================================================
' COMPONENT DEFINITION
' =======================================================
actor "Registered User" as RU
participant "Mobile Application" as Client

' Componente che gestisce l'archivio locale
participant "Inventory Handling" as IH

' Servizio Esterno per il rendering mappe
participant "MapServiceProvider" as Map

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over RU, Client: Entry Condition: RU selects "My recorded trips"

' =======================================================
' (a) SYSTEM SHOWS THE SESSIONS LOG
' =======================================================
RU -> Client: clickMyRecordedTrips()
activate Client

note right of Client: Request local session history
Client -> IH: retrieveUserSessions()
activate IH

' Accesso al File System Locale
note right of IH: **Local File System Access**\nScan directory for session logs
IH -> IH: readLocalSessionFiles()

' Ritorno lista sommari
IH --> Client: returnSessionSummaries(List<SessionSummary>)
deactivate IH

' Visualizzazione Lista
Client --> RU: displaySessionLog(list_of_trips)

' =======================================================
' (b) RU FINDS AND SELECTS THE SESSION
' =======================================================
RU -> Client: selectSession(sessionID)

' 1. Recupero Dati Sessione dallo Storage Locale
note right of Client: Step 1: Fetch full raw data from file
Client -> IH: getFullSessionData(sessionID)
activate IH

note right of IH: Read JSON/XML file from device storage
IH -> IH: readSessionFile(sessionID)
note right of IH: Returns: Waypoints, Speed, Elev, Meteo
IH --> Client: SessionFullData
deactivate IH

' 2. Recupero Mappa dal Service Provider
note right of Client: Step 2: Request map background for specific coords
Client -> Map: requestMapContext(SessionFullData.coordinates)
activate Map
Map --> Client: MapTiles/VectorData
deactivate Map

' Rendering lato Client
note right of Client: **Rendering Logic:**\nCombine Map Tiles with Local GPS Path
Client -> Client: renderMapPath(GPS_Points, MapTiles)
Client -> Client: computeGraphs(Metrics)

Client --> RU: displaySessionDetails(data, map, metrics)

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
RU -> Client: pressExit()
Client -> Client: clearDetailView()
Client --> RU: returnToMenu()
note over RU, Client: Exit Condition: RU closes the log page

deactivate Client
@enduml